  "title": "Bracing for Hurricane Trudy on the Pacific Coast",
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Hurricane Trudy is battering the Pacific coast with heavy rain and strong winds.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "Hurricane Trudy",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "On Sunday, Trudy was about 135 miles west-southwest of Manzanillo moving northwest at 10 mph.",
      "shot": "photo:1",
      "card": {
        "big": "Moving Northwest",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "In Michoacan, Colima, and Jalisco, isolated totals of around 12 inches of rain fell.",
      "shot": "photo:2",
      "card": {
        "big": "12 Inches of Rain",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Mexican navy officials urged mariners and coastal residents to exercise extreme caution now.",
      "shot": "photo:3",
      "card": {
        "big": "Extreme Caution",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Authorities warned that heavy rainfall could cause damage because the ground is already saturated.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "Saturated Ground",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Hurricane center warnings highlight potentially life-threatening flooding and mudslides in steep terrain.",
      "shot": "photo:1",
      "card": {
        "big": "Life-Threatening Risks",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Trudy is expected to move south of the Baja California Peninsula on Monday.",
      "shot": "photo:2",
      "card": {
        "big": "Moving South",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "The storm center remains near the coast through Sunday evening.",
      "shot": "photo:3",
      "card": {
        "big": "Sunday Evening",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow Orbitwire for the stories the whole world is talking about.",
      "shot": "outro",
      "card": {
        "big": "Orbitwire",
        "small": "Sources in the description"
      },
      "pause_after": 0.5
    }
  ],
